{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ Built-in StikJIT needs iOS 26, LocalDevVPN, and a pairing file, which Husk can make itself on iOS 27.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@内置 StikJIT 需要 iOS 26、LocalDevVPN 和配对文件；在 iOS 27 上 Husk 可以自己生成配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Orientation and resolution apply the next time the game starts, and a game already running in this session needs Husk closed and opened again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@方向和分辨率会在游戏下次启动时生效；如果游戏已在本次会话中运行，需要先完全关闭 Husk 再打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is compressed inside its bundle, which Husk cannot unpack yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 在它的捆绑包内是压缩的，Husk 目前无法解压。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is gone from Android.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已从 Android 中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is ready to launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已可以启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ of %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ / %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was started in this session, and a game cannot be unloaded once it has started. Close Husk completely and open it again to run %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已在本次会话中启动过，而游戏一旦启动就无法卸载。请完全关闭 Husk 再打开，即可运行 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Open the Android screen and check it is running, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@。请打开 Android 屏幕确认它仍在运行，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld apps": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld controllers": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个控制器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld files": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld files sent": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已发送 %lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min · first boot takes 5–15 min": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 分钟 · 首次启动需要 5–15 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of them use tricks the older loader could not handle; the native runtime handles those too, except for optional anti-tamper code, which it leaves out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中 %lld 个使用了旧加载器无法处理的技巧；原生运行时也能处理，只是会略过可选的反篡改代码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%  ·  %@  ·  %@ elapsed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%%  ·  %@  ·  已用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%llu frame(s) drawn · native runtime": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已绘制 %llu 帧 · 原生运行时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 file": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 pixel per point. Fastest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 1 像素。最快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1.5 pixels per point.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 1.5 像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1280": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1280"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 pixels per point. The default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每点 2 像素。默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "720": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "720"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A %@ game. It runs through Husk's native runtime, which loads its %lld arm64 libraries itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是一个 %@ 游戏。它通过 Husk 的原生运行时运行，由运行时自行加载它的 %lld 个 arm64 库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A change takes effect the next time Husk opens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更改将在下次打开 Husk 时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A custom resolution sets the shape itself, so this does nothing while it is on. Type a wide size for landscape.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自定义分辨率本身就已决定屏幕形状，因此开启它时这一项不起作用。横屏请填写较宽的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Android image is available": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新的 Android 系统镜像可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new pre-booted snapshot is available": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新的预启动快照可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APK installed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APK or bundle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 或捆绑包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APKs install from the Library's + button or from the Files tab. Split sets — a base APK plus its config pieces — must be picked together; installing the base alone fails on missing native libraries.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "APK 可以从应用库的 + 按钮或「文件」标签页安装。分包 APK——基础 APK 加上它的配置分片——必须一起选择；只安装基础 APK 会因为缺少原生库而失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ATTEMPT LOG": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accent Colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "强调色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Active Repositories": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已启用的仓库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add APK": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 APK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add App": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an APK and it will be installed into the Android runtime, then appear here with its own icon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个 APK，它会被安装到 Android 运行环境中，然后带着自己的图标出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %@…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在添加 %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding %lld APKs…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在添加 %lld 个 APK…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. Android cannot be saved while this is on, so every launch boots from cold.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个声音设备。开启后无法保存 Android，因此每次启动都是冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a sound device. While it is attached Android cannot be saved — QEMU refuses to snapshot a machine with one — so every launch boots from cold. Turning it on or off costs a cold boot either way.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加一个声音设备。只要它处于附加状态，Android 就无法保存——QEMU 拒绝对带有声音设备的机器做快照——所以每次启动都是冷启动。无论开启还是关闭，代价都是一次冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次下载会多出约 2 GB。该快照是在软件渲染器上采集的，因此在 GPU 模式下不会使用——GPU 模式会先冷启动一次，然后保存自己的快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Almost worth the wait": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "差不多值得等"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always this look.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终保持这一外观。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android Is Not Running": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 未在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. StikJIT is built into Husk and is the recommended way: it turns JIT on from inside the app, with no computer and no other app. StikDebug and TrollStore work too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 和翻译层游戏都需要 JIT，而在 iOS 上只有附加的调试器才能授予它。StikJIT 已内置于 Husk，也是推荐方式：它无需电脑、无需其他应用，直接在应用内开启 JIT。StikDebug 和 TrollStore 同样可行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 和翻译层游戏需要 JIT。内置于 Husk 的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps, on your iPhone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上运行 Android 应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android apps, on your iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 iPhone 上运行 Android 应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 一旦运行就无法改变屏幕形状，因此横屏游戏在竖屏上会被压成一条加黑边的窄带，看起来很小。只有开局就建成横屏才能填满屏幕——反过来竖屏应用会被加黑边。代价是一次冷启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 通过 Metal 在真实 GPU 上绘制——帧率约为四倍。这是默认设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android installs it from where it already is — nothing is copied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 会就地安装它——不会复制任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is booting…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 正在启动…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is locked. Open the Android screen, unlock it, and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 已锁定。请打开 Android 屏幕解锁后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is locked. Unlock it and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 已锁定。请解锁后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android is ready": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 已就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android libraries it needs": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它需要的 Android 库"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 通过 QEMU 自有网络上的虚拟网卡访问互联网。你手机所在的网络看不到客户机，客户机也看不到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android will boot from cold once, then save a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 会先冷启动一次，然后保存一个新的快照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android's native code expects things of the processor and of memory that only the phone can answer -- above all, whether a library's code can run with its data writable right beside it. Enable JIT first, or the memory checks are skipped. The results go to the console too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 的原生代码对处理器和内存有特定要求，只有这台手机能给出答案——其中最要紧的是，一个库的代码能否在紧邻其可写数据的情况下运行。请先启用 JIT，否则会跳过内存检查。结果也会写入控制台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Android: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another game is already loaded": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已加载另一个游戏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Icon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用图标"
          }
