    "Husk": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not announce itself on the local network. Check that Wi-Fi is on, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 无法在本地网络上广播自己。请确认 Wi-Fi 已开启，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not copy it: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 无法复制它：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk could not open its pairing port.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 无法打开配对端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk couldn't reach this device. Connect LocalDevVPN, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 联系不上这台设备。请连接 LocalDevVPN 后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs Local Network access to pair. Allow it in Settings › Apps › Husk, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 需要本地网络权限才能配对。请在「设置 › 应用 › Husk」中允许，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs its Android runtime — about 760 MB. Android itself is downloaded afterwards by the runtime.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 需要它的 Android 运行环境——约 760 MB。Android 本身随后由运行环境下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so Husk tests both rather than assuming.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 需要既能写入又能执行的内存，而在 iOS 上这需要附加调试器。有两条路可走：由调试器响应陷阱请求，或使用 MAP_JIT 映射——内核对任何被调试的进程都允许它。两者有其一即可；哪一条可用取决于设备和 iOS 版本，因此 Husk 会实际测试而不是想当然。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk pairing code: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 配对码：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 会恢复已保存的机器而不是重新启动，只需几秒而不是几分钟。写入期间画面会冻结。关闭此项后不会有任何自动保存——安装之后也不会。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs a real Android system and opens APKs inside it. A few questions first — all of them can be changed later in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 运行一个真正的 Android 系统，并在其中打开 APK。先问几个问题——全都可以稍后在「设置」中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows Husk's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 在你的 iPhone 上运行真正的 Android 系统，并直接运行未经修改的 APK。控制台显示 Husk 的实时日志、客户机的串口输出和 QEMU 自身的输出——这里出现的任何问题都要靠这三个文件来诊断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk turns the screen the way the game asks for.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 按游戏的要求旋转屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk was marked as debugged when it opened, so JIT is on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 启动时已被标记为已调试，因此 JIT 已开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use StikDebug.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 将使用 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk will use TrollStore.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 将使用 TrollStore。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper (%@) could not be found: %@ Reinstall Husk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 Husk 的 JIT 辅助程序（%@）：%@ 请重新安装 Husk。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper did not start. Reinstall Husk, and keep its app extensions if your sideloader asks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
