            "value": "Husk 的 JIT 辅助程序没有启动。请重新安装 Husk；如果你的侧载工具询问，请保留它的应用扩展。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper finished without an answer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 的 JIT 辅助程序结束时没有返回结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper is missing from this installation. Reinstall Husk, and keep its app extensions if your sideloader asks, or use StikDebug.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这次安装中缺少 Husk 的 JIT 辅助程序。请重新安装 Husk；如果你的侧载工具询问，请保留它的应用扩展，或改用 StikDebug。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Husk's JIT helper stopped unexpectedly. Try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
