    "It is a landscape game: Husk turns the screen for it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是横屏游戏：Husk 会为它旋转屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It opens as soon as Android answers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 一有响应它就会打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will be gone on the next launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次启动时它就会消失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's connected": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its data goes with it. Save Android afterwards or the change is lost on the next launch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的数据会一并删除。之后请保存 Android，否则这次更改会在下次启动时丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own libraries link against these, and it does not carry them. Each is something the translation layer has to provide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它自己的库依赖这些库，而它并不自带。每一个都需要翻译层来提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
