    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it to turn JIT on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 已安装，Husk 会打开它来开启 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is installed, so Husk will open it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikDebug 已安装，Husk 会打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug is not installed. Install it, or set up Built-in StikJIT.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装 StikDebug。请安装它，或设置内置 StikJIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug, TrollStore and a jailbreak were not found, so Husk will use its built-in helper.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未找到 StikDebug、TrollStore 和越狱，因此 Husk 将使用内置辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikJIT is built into Husk. You can turn JIT on right here — no computer and no other app. Games and Android both need it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StikJIT 已内置于 Husk。你可以在这里直接开启 JIT——无需电脑，也无需其他应用。游戏和 Android 都需要它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Success: The guest drew frames!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "成功：客户机绘制出了画面！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows the phone: light by day, dark by night. The guest's own screen stays dark either way — it is a picture of another phone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「跟随系统」随手机变化：白天浅色，夜晚深色。无论哪种，客户机自己的屏幕都保持深色——那只是另一台手机的画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tablet — 1280 × 800": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平板 — 1280 × 800"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap with three fingers to show the interface": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三指轻点可显示界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teaching an iPhone to speak Android": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "教 iPhone 说 Android 语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Technical detail in the Android Translation Layer screens: library reports, device checks and run logs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译层各界面中的技术细节：库报告、设备检查和运行日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That bundle uses a zip format (Zip64) Husk does not read yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该捆绑包使用了 Husk 尚不支持的 zip 格式（Zip64）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not a bundle Husk can read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件不是 Husk 能读取的捆绑包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a remote pairing file. Make one with the StikDebug pairing-file guide and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是远程配对文件。请按 StikDebug 的配对文件指南生成一个，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The debugger is attached but is not answering trap requests, and this device will not execute a MAP_JIT mapping either, so no executable memory could be claimed. This is what happens when Husk runs inside another container app rather than sideloaded on its own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调试器已附加，但不响应陷阱请求，而这台设备也不执行 MAP_JIT 映射，因此无法取得可执行内存。当 Husk 运行在另一个容器应用内、而不是独立侧载时，就会出现这种情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded image did not match the release. Tap to retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载的镜像与发布版本不符。轻点重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game exited": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game is loaded in this session. Close Husk completely and open it again to reset its data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏已在本次会话中加载。请完全关闭 Husk 再打开，才能重置它的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout, the picture to every edge. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing, but leaves the strip the bar sat in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏启动时画面上什么都没有：没有工具条，没有控制器，没有读数，画面铺满每一个边缘。三指同时轻点可唤回工具条，再点一次收起。游戏过程中工具条上的「隐藏」按钮效果相同，但会留下工具条所占的那一条区域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper did not attach within 90 seconds. Check that LocalDevVPN is connected, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助程序在 90 秒内没有附加。请确认 LocalDevVPN 已连接，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language Husk is drawn in. Android and the apps inside it keep their own, chosen in Android's settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Husk 界面所用的语言。Android 和其中的应用有各自的语言，在 Android 的设置里选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份列表已写入磁盘，因此在 Android 启动完成之前就能显示出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对文件保存在 Husk 的「文档」文件夹中，只会发送给 Husk 自己的辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕在机器启动时构建，因此每次更改都要付出一次冷启动的代价，而下一次保存会替换掉以旧尺寸保存的机器——改回去又要再一次。尺寸会取整到 8 的倍数。越大越慢：每个像素都由模拟的手机绘制。Android 的密度不随屏幕变化，所以更大的屏幕显示的是更多内容，而不是更大的画面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按顺序推进的计划写在 Husk 源码的 docs/04-translation-layer.md 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request for Husk's JIT helper could not be encoded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发给 Husk JIT 辅助程序的请求无法编码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The runtime on disk is not a valid image (%@). Tap to retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "磁盘上的运行环境不是有效镜像（%@）。轻点重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snapshot did not match the release (sha256 %@, expected %@).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "快照与发布版本不符（sha256 %@，应为 %@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
